  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>What do I need to get started?</summary>
          <p>A Zoom (or Fathom) account, a YouTube channel, and — if you publish to a course platform —
          an LMS that exposes an API. You connect them once in the dashboard.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I have to keep the tab open?</summary>
          <p>No. Set a schedule and VideoRouter routes new recordings on its own. You can also push any recording manually with one click.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can it publish into my course platform / LMS?</summary>
          <p>Yes — that's the point. Set a rule and each recording is filed into the right LMS course and module automatically, in addition to YouTube. Your LMS needs a video-ingest API. You can also push to YouTube and to your LMS as two separate one-click actions — upload now, file it into a course when you're ready.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I preview and download the original recording?</summary>
          <p>Yes. On Sources, click <b>Preview</b> to play any <b>Zoom or Fathom</b> recording in the dashboard (and pick the exact view), then <b>Download</b> to save the original straight to your computer — free, and without signing in to the source. Handy when you need the file to edit, archive or re-share.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does it work if my recordings are 2–4&nbsp;GB?</summary>
          <p>Yes. We stream the full file to YouTube and your LMS, so large 2–4&nbsp;GB class recordings go through cleanly — where tools that just pass a URL tend to fail.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can my team help run it?</summary>
          <p>Yes — add staff with view or edit permissions once you're on Always-On <b>or</b> have topped up ₹1,000+. It's designed to be simple enough for anyone to operate.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How is it priced?</summary>
          <p>Pay as you go from ₹50 per GB of transfer (billed for the actual data transferred — a 2.5&nbsp;GB file is 2.5&nbsp;GB, not rounded up), dropping to ₹45 and ₹40 on bigger packs. Your first upload is free. Add your GSTIN for a GST invoice. Optional Always-On (₹999/month) unlocks the daily scheduler and unlimited staff; staff also unlock with a ₹1,000+ top-up. Transfers stay pay-as-you-go on top.</p></details>
      </div>
